# Test Plan: SauceDemo

## 1. Goal
Check that the main shopping flow on https://www.saucedemo.com works correctly, and find any bugs.

## 2. What I will test (in scope)
- Login (valid user, locked-out user, wrong password, empty fields)
- Products page (adding and removing items)
- Cart (item count, removing items)
- Checkout information form (first name, last name, postal code)
- Checkout overview and order confirmation
- Logout

## 3. What I will not test (out of scope)
- Performance and load testing
- Security testing
- Sign-up (the site has no sign-up feature)
- Behaviour of users other than standard_user

## 4. Test approach
- Manual testing first, written as test cases
- Then automate the most important tests with Playwright

## 5. Test data
- Main user: standard_user (shared password shown on the login page)
- locked_out_user is used only for the locked-out login check (TC-04)
- Other users (such as problem_user) are out of scope for this project

